246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 62 0 R
/T (Since our formation in 2015, CSI has sent over 15 teams across the US to pitch their projects to NASA panels \(Blue Skies, Micro-g, RASC-AL, SUITS\), launched the first student-built hybrid LOX rocket \(Rockets\), deployed a satellite to low earth orbit \(CubeSat\), engaged in over 10,000 hours of community service \(Outreach\), launched dozens high-altitude weather balloons and pico-balloons \(Balloons\), and accomplished much more. )
/E (Since our formation in 2015, CSI has sent over 15 teams across the US to pitch their projects to NASA panels \(Blue Skies, Micro-g, RASC-AL, SUITS\), launched the first student-built hybrid LOX rocket \(Rockets\), deployed a satellite to low earth orbit \(CubeSat\), engaged in over 10,000 hours of community service \(Outreach\), launched dozens high-altitude weather balloons and pico-balloons \(Balloons\), and accomplished much more. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 62 0 R
/T (We provide the Columbia community with the opportunity to gain real, hands-on experience in aerospace engineering and its related fields. We host speaker events with former astronauts, NASA directors, and industry experts. Our missions research, build, and design using the resources provided by the Columbia Makerspace, Mechanical Engineering Teaching Lab, and the Biomedical Engineering Lab. With this experience, our members pursue industry opportunities at organizations like NASA, Blue Origin, SpaceX, academic opportunities at schools including MIT, Caltech, Stanford, and prestigious fellowships including the Marshall Scholarship and Hertz Fellowship.)
/E (We provide the Columbia community with the opportunity to gain real, hands-on experience in aerospace engineering and its related fields. We host speaker events with former astronauts, NASA directors, and industry experts. Our missions research, build, and design using the resources provided by the Columbia Makerspace, Mechanical Engineering Teaching Lab, and the Biomedical Engineering Lab. With this experience, our members pursue industry opportunities at organizations like NASA, Blue Origin, SpaceX, academic opportunities at schools including MIT, Caltech, Stanford, and prestigious fellowships including the Marshall Scholarship and Hertz Fellowship.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
