/P 62 0 R
/T (CSI fosters one of the strongest communities on campus. With 500+ members from over 40 majors across all 4 Columbia schools, we strive to create a supportive, motivating environment that helps students realize and achieve their ambitions and goals. Your support helps us serve our members with the opportunities they deserve.)
