/Title (Since our formation in 2015, CSI has sent over 15 teams across the US to pitch their projects to NASA panels \(Blue Skies, Micro-g, RASC-AL, SUITS\), launched the first student-built hybrid LOX rocket \(Rockets\), deployed a satellite to low earth orbit \(CubeSat\), engaged in over 10,000 hours of community service \(Outreach\), launched dozens high-altitude weather balloons and pico-balloons \(Balloons\), and accomplished much more.)
