/Title (We provide the Columbia community with the opportunity to gain real, hands-on experience in aerospace engineering and its related fields. We host speaker events with former astronauts, NASA directors, and industry experts. Our missions research, build, and design using the resources provided by the Columbia Makerspace, Mechanical Engineering Teaching Lab, and the Biomedical Engineering Lab. With this experience, our members pursue industry opportunities at organizations like NASA, Blue Origin, SpaceX, academic opportunities at schools including MIT, Caltech, Stanford, and prestigious fellowships including the Marshall Scholarship and Hertz Fellowship.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 990 0 R
/Prev 1085 0 R
/Next 1149 0 R
>>
endobj
1149 0 obj
<<
/Title (CSI fosters one of the strongest communities on campus. With 500+ members from over 40 majors across all 4 Columbia schools, we strive to create a supportive, motivating environment that helps students realize and achieve their ambitions and goals. Your support helps us serve our members with the opportunities they deserve.)
